{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>בכרך (your firstborn)</b> — bet, עשו (Esau) [is in] בכרך. \"I am killing your son בכרך (your firstborn).\" For Jacob said: \"I am he concerning whom it is said, 'My son, My firstborn, Israel,' but Esau your son — בכורך (your firstborn) is said concerning him; [therefore I say:] 'Here I am, [about to] kill your son בכרך (your firstborn).'\""], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 27, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:17:10.340466864Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}